                  "n": 1,
                  "text": "smaller quantity of abnormal haemoglobin<b> ; </b>",
                  "numberedInMs": false
                },
                {
                  "n": 2,
                  "text": "fewer red blood cells become sickled / sickling less severe <b>; ORA </b>",
                  "numberedInMs": false
                },
                {
