            "aiSupplement": {
              "explanation": [
                {
                  "text": "Expression of a normal allele can provide enough functional haemoglobin for effective oxygen transport even though some abnormal haemoglobin is also produced. The amount of abnormal protein and the severity of cell sickling influence the clinical effect.",
