            51
          ],
          "printedPage": null
        }
      },
      "heading": "Question 7 (b)(i)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": null,
          "bullets": [
            "A majority of candidates were able to show that in codominance both alleles would be expressed in the phenotype in a heterozygous condition."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "er.q7.b.ii",
