        }
      },
      "heading": "Question 7 (b)(ii)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": null,
          "bullets": [
            "Many candidates were able to suggest a reason why people with sickle cell trait did not show the symptoms of sickle cell anaemia, such as there being less abnormal haemoglobin or fewer red blood cells becoming sickle shaped."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
