      "heading": "Question 7 (b)(iii)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "heading": null,
          "bullets": [
            "Most candidates were able to carry out this genetic cross between two people with sickle cell trait. It is important to note that some credit was lost due to a lack of clarity when describing the offspring phenotypes. Some mistakenly suggested that sickle cell anaemia was sex-linked and gained no credit."
          ]
